 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "hero",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/b/csm_toolmanagement_header_ab8ef9c82c.webp",
     "video": null,
     "title": "Tool Management – More Than Just Tool Management",
     "kicker": "",
     "text": "",
     "buttons": [],
     "light": false
    }
   ],
   "ftype": "zoller_hero-slider",
   "id": "c8115",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "",
   "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">Modern tool management encompasses numerous aspects—it involves tool data management, storage, transportation, and ordering of tools and tool components, but above all, it’s about one thing: more effective, improved work processes.</p> <p class=\"extra-large-text\">With a good tool management system, you have a clear view of and control over every phase of your tools’ lifecycle—and you can decide for yourself the level of detail and complexity at which you want to maintain that overview.</p>",
   "images": [],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "text",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "top",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c8116",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Tool Management: Inventory Control, Planning, Checks </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Tool management, for example, involves centrally entering and managing all tools and tool components. This allows you to gain and maintain an overview of your tools and components, as well as optimize your inventory, plan and check tool usage—and order new tools and components at exactly the right time, just-in-time.</p> <p>With the right software, you gain full transparency into how and where your tools are being used—across the entire process chain. This also means better cost control, optimized workflows, and more effective use of your tools.</p> <p>Tool management also means that all tool data is managed centrally and, ideally, transferred directly to your CAM systems via suitable interfaces. This simplifies and shortens the setup process, making the set up of your tools faster and more reliable.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/4/csm_tms_connected_3fe459a22a.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 900
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c8117",
