      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Perfectly organized",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Enter all individual components, complete tools, and setup sheets in a central database.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8122",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Lossless Interfaces",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>With numerous interfaces, you can integrate the ZOLLER-TMS with your CAM systems—the error-free digital transmission of tool data saves time, hassle, and money.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8124",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "stock management",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Everything lies in its place—with ZOLLER-TMS, you always know exactly where your components and tools are. At the same time, this allows you to keep track of your stock levels in an efficient manner.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8126",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tool Monitoring",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Centralize quality control and wear analysis in one place, check your tool usage, and generate statistics on individual orders and your costs.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8128",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Transparency and Effectiveness",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Integrate your management processes with your ordering processes to ensure you always order exactly what you need, right on time. Identify problems in the production process and ensure smooth operations.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textmedia",
          "id": "c8130",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
